  "releaseNotes": "Add host/DNS constructors and Connect overloads:\n      - Provide convenience constructors for host string and DnsEndPoint across client types (HttpClient, HttpsClient, WsClient, WssClient, TcpClient, UdpClient, StreamClientTransport, SslClient) and simplify constructor chaining to call base(...) where appropriate.\n      - Add Connect(string) and ConnectAsync(string) in ClientTransport which create a DnsEndPoint and choose default ports (443 for SSL clients, 80 otherwise).\n      - Import the SSL transport namespace used by the new overloads. These changes improve API ergonomics for connecting by host name/DNS endpoint.",
